.TH SANCHALA-GAMING 1 "August 2026" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-gaming \- Gaming optimization and launcher for Sanchala OS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-gaming
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sanchala-gaming
optimizes system performance for gaming and provides a unified game
launcher integrating Steam, Lutris, and native games.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B mode \fR[\fBon\fR|\fBoff\fR|\fBstatus\fR]
Toggle gaming mode (performance optimizations)
.TP
.B launch \fIGAME\fR
Launch a game
.TP
.B library
Show game library
.TP
.B wine \fR[\fBstatus\fR|\fBinstall\fR]
Manage Wine/Proton
.TP
.B drivers
Check graphics driver status
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output in JSON format
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help message
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/sanchala/gaming/gaming.toml
Configuration file
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR gamemoded (8),
.BR steam (1),
.BR lutris (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team <dev@sanchala.id>
